  If rank(M11) climbs above 2 once the state is genuinely mixed and the
  interval goes asymmetric, then directionality enters through the RESET,
  not the kick - and Corollary 3's symmetry is a first-cycle artefact of
  starting pure. If it stays symmetric, the obstruction is deeper than
  purity and no single-ancilla unitary feedback can prefer cooling at all.
